    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Higa ndigo maneno ga mwisho ga Daudi, mwana wa Jese, ambaye Mlungu wamuhenda akale mkpwulu. Iye ariyepakpwa mafuha ni Mlungu wa Jakobo, naye kala ni mtungadzi wa mawira manono ga Iziraeli, naye waamba hivi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Higa ndigo madzina ga masujaa a Daudi; Joshebu-Bashebethi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Dzina renye rafupishwa kukala Jashobeamu.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.11.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Nyakati 11:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kula Hakimoni. Hiyu kala ndiye chilongozi wa hara ahahu. Hiye waolaga atu magana manane kpwa wakati mmwenga, kpwa kuhumira fumore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kula iye aredza Eliazari mwana wa Dodo wa mbari ya Ahohi. Iye kala ni mmwenga wa hara masujaa ahahu ariokala phamwenga na Daudi ariphoalaphiza Afilisti ariokala akakusanyika ili apigane. Atu a Iziraeli kala akauya nyuma, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela Eliazari waima, achiapiga Afilisti hadi mkpwonowe uchiremwa, chiasi cha kukala fumbare richikala rikagama na upangawe. Mwenyezi Mlungu siku iyo wareha ushindi mkpwulu, ndipho Aiziraeli ayae achimuuyira kuhala zewe tu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wa hahu wao kala ni Shama mwana wa Agee kula Harari. Siku mwenga Afilisti kala akakusanyika hiko Lehi, phatu phariphokala na munda uriokala u tele dengu, nao Aiziraeli achimbira nyo Afilisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Shama waima kahi-kahi ya nyo munda, achiuhehera, na achiaolaga Afilisti. Naye Mwenyezi Mlungu achiapha ushindi mkpwulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku mwenga masujaa ahahu kahi ya hara masujaa mirongo mihahu bora zaidi atserera wakati wa msimu wa mavuno hadi kpwa Daudi hiko pango ra Adulamu. Siku hizo jeshi ra Afilisti kala rikachita kambi Dete ra Arafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati hinyo Daudi kala a hiko ngomeni, na chikosi chimwenga cha jeshi ra Afilisti kala chi Bethilehemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Daudi achikala na chiru achiambira atue achiamba, “Ni ani ndiyeweza kunipha madzi ga kunwa kula chisima chiricho phephi na ryango ra Bethilehemu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi hinyo masujaa ahahu adudula kahi-kahi ya jeshi ra Afilisti, achendaheka madzi kula hicho chisima cha Bethilehemu, chiricho phephi na ryango, achimrehera Daudi. Ela Daudi warema kuganwa, badalaye wagamwaga dza sadaka kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achiamba, “Ee Mwenyezi Mlungu, mino sindahenda dzambo hiri. Ni kama kunwa milatso ya hinyo atu achiozindza maisha gao kpwendaheka madzi higa.” Kpwa hivyo Daudi warema kuganwa. Higo ndigo arigohenda hinyo masujaa ahahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abishai mwanao wa Joabu mwana wa Seruya wakala ni mkpwulu wa hara masujaa ahahu. Iye wahumira fumore kuolaga atu magana mahahu. Phahi wamanyikana sawa na hara masujaa ahahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiye waishimiwa kano mbiri zaidi, kpwa hivyo achikala mkpwulu wao, dzagbwe kayakala dza nyo ahahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaya, mwana wa Jehoyada kala ni sujaa kula Kabuseeli, ariyehenda mambo makulu. Ndiye ariyeolaga masujaa airi kula Moabu. Piya wakati wanjina wakpwendaolaga simba ndani ya dibwa wakati wa barafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na piya waolaga Mmisiri, mutu mure sana. Mmisiri iye kala ana fumo, ela Benaya wamlunga na gongo, achimfuta ro fumo na achimuolaga naro mwenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Higo ndigo arigohenda Benaya mwana wa Jehoyada, na achimanyikana dza hara masujaa ahahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye kala anaishimiwa kutsupa hara masujaa mirongo mihahu, ela kala si mmwenga wa hara ahahu. Naye Daudi wamuika akale mkpwulu wa arindzie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kahi za hara masujaa mirongo mihahu kala ni Asaheli mwanao wa Joabu, Elihanani mwana wa Dodo kula Bethilehemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shama kula Harodi, Elika kula Harodi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Helesi kula Paliti, Ira mwana wa Ikeshi kula Tekoa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiezeri kula Anathothi, Mebunai kula Husha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Salimoni kula Ahohi, Maharai kula Netofa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Helebu mwana wa Baana kula Netofa, Itai mwana wa Ribai kula Gibeya ya Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaya kula Pirathoni, Hidai kula vidzuho vya Gaashi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abi-Aliboni kula Araba, Azimawethi kula Bahurimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliahiba kula Shaaliboni, ana a Jasheni; Jonathani ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwana wa Shama kula Harari, Ahiamu mwana wa Sharari kula Harari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
